  m_text: Tow into the loading cradle and stop. Press ACTION to unhitch and lock
    the actual sling. While loaded, movement UP/DOWN adjusts winch assist and LEFT/RIGHT
    changes the spring-held arm's physical starting angle. Press ACTION to start
    the counterweight swing, then press ACTION during the swing to release the real
    trailer at its current velocity. Longest Toss scores supported throw distance.
    Accuracy scores final distance from the target. Castle Demolition scores genuine
    trailer/target collision chains. Multi-Round Siege gives three independently
    loaded physical throws with cumulative distance, accuracy and damage. Let the
    projectile land and settle; a timeout or fall earns no unproven resting-position
    bonus.
